%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116162917.png&#39; alt=&#34;/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116162917.png&#34; height=&#34;741&#34; width=&#34;1381&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;http://localhost:1313/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116162936.png&#39; alt=&#34;/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116162936.png&#34; height=&#34;818&#34; width=&#34;1019&#34;&gt;&#xA;pg的数据表叫&lt;strong&gt;堆表文件&lt;/strong&gt;，是磁盘上一个数字命名的没有后缀名的文件这个数字代表这张数据表在数据库里的ID，又叫relfileNode,数据表越大，堆表文件也就越大，而当堆表文件超过1GB时，会自动分割为多个文件&#xA;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;http://localhost:1313/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116172222.png&#39; alt=&#34;/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116172222.png&#34; height=&#34;479&#34; width=&#34;783&#34;&gt;&#xA;堆表文件里会将数据拆分成一个一个数据页来存储，每页8KB，这样只需要读取磁盘里的页就可以，比读写整个表要快很多&#xA;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#39;http://localhost:1313/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116172914.png&#39; alt=&#34;/%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%9C%BA%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80/%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/postgresql%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/images/PostgreSQL%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93/Pasted-image-20251116172914.png&#34; height=&#34;753&#34; width=&#34;1584&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
